{
  "sn2.29:0.1": "Linked Discourses 2.29 ",
  "sn2.29:0.2": "3. Various Sectarians ",
  "sn2.29:0.3": "With Susīma ",
  "sn2.29:1.1": "At Sāvatthī. ",
  "sn2.29:1.2": "Then Venerable Ānanda went up to the Buddha, bowed, and sat down to one side. The Buddha said to him, ",
  "sn2.29:1.3": "“Ānanda, do you endorse Sāriputta?” ",
  "sn2.29:2.1": "“Sir, who on earth would not endorse Venerable Sāriputta unless they’re a fool, a hater, delusional, or mentally deranged? ",
  "sn2.29:2.2": "Venerable Sāriputta is astute, ",
  "sn2.29:2.3": "he has great wisdom, ",
  "sn2.29:2.4": "widespread wisdom, ",
  "sn2.29:2.5": "laughing wisdom, ",
  "sn2.29:2.6": "swift wisdom, ",
  "sn2.29:2.7": "sharp wisdom, ",
  "sn2.29:2.8": "and penetrating wisdom. ",
  "sn2.29:2.9": "He has few wishes, ",
  "sn2.29:2.10": "he’s content, ",
  "sn2.29:2.11": "secluded, ",
  "sn2.29:2.12": "aloof, ",
  "sn2.29:2.13": "and energetic. ",
  "sn2.29:2.14": "He is a preacher, ",
  "sn2.29:2.15": "and he accepts advice; ",
  "sn2.29:2.16": "he accuses ",
  "sn2.29:2.17": "and criticizes wickedness. ",
  "sn2.29:2.18": "Who on earth would not endorse Venerable Sāriputta unless they’re a fool, a hater, delusional, or mentally deranged?” ",
  "sn2.29:3.1": "“That’s so true, Ānanda! That’s so true! ",
  "sn2.29:3.2": "Who on earth would not endorse Venerable Sāriputta unless they’re a fool, a hater, delusional, or mentally deranged?” ",
  "sn2.29:3.3": "And the Buddha repeated all of Ānanda’s terms of praise. "